	(text "The Wio-SX1262 LoRa board plugs onto the connector on top of the XIAO.\nD8, D9 and D10 are its SPI bus: leave them unconnected.\nD2 is a boot strapping pin of the ESP32-S3: left free on purpose.\nUse an external 868 MHz antenna (U.FL) outside any metal enclosure."
